msgid ""
"<p>...that the tab text color can be changed with the code \\e[28;COLORt "
"(COLOR: 0-16,777,215)?\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:13
msgid ""
"<p>...that the code \\e[8;ROW;COLUMNt will resize Konsole?\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:18
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can start a new standard session by pressing the \"New\" button "
"in the tabbar?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan begin nuwe Konsole sessies deur gedruk die \"nuwe\" knoppie in "
"die Konsole nutsbalk?\n"

#: tips.cpp:23
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing and holding the \"New\" button on the tabbar will display a "
"menu of sessions to select?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat gedruk en hou die \"Nuwe\" knoppie in die Konsole nutsbalk sal "
"toelaat jy na\n"
"kies wat sessie tipe die \"Nuwe\" knoppie beginne?\n"

#: tips.cpp:28
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing Ctrl+Alt+N will start a new standard session?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat gedruk Ctrl+Alt+n is die selfde as te kliek die \"Nuwe\" knoppie in "
"die nutsbalk?\n"

#: tips.cpp:33
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can cycle through the Konsole sessions by holding down the Shift "
"key and\n"
"pressing the Left or Right Arrow keys?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan wissel deur die Konsole sessies deur hou ondertoe die "
"Verskuiwende sleutel en\n"
"gedruk die Links of Regterkant Pyl sleutels?\n"

#: tips.cpp:39
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can get a 'Linux console-like' terminal? \n"
"<p>Hide Konsole's menubar, tabbar and scrollbar, select the Linux font\n"
"and the Linux Colors schema and apply the full-screen mode. You might also \n"
"want to set the KDE panel to auto-hide.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan kry 'n 'Linux console-like' terminaal? \n"
"<p>Deaktiveer die Konsole se kiesbalk, nutsbalk en rolstaaf, kies die Linux "
"skrif tipe\n"
"en die Linux Kleure skema en wend aan die vol-skerm modus. jy dalk asook dan "
"word\n"
"wil hê na stel die paneel na auto-hide.\n"

#: tips.cpp:47
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can rename your Konsole sessions by clicking with the right "
"mouse\n"
"button and selecting \"Rename session\"? The change will be reflected in the\n"
"Konsole tabbar, making it easier to remember the content of the session.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan herbenaam jou Konsole sessies deur te kliek met die regterkant "
"muis\n"
"knoppie en deur te kies \"herbenaam sessie\"? die verander sal wees reflekteer "
"in die\n"
"Konsole nutsbalk, maak dit makliker na onthou die inhoud van die sessie.\n"

#: tips.cpp:54
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can rename a Konsole session by double-clicking its tab?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan herbenaam 'n Konsole sessie deur double-clicking sy knoppie\n"
"in die Konsole nutsbalk?\n"

#: tips.cpp:59
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can activate the menu with the Ctrl+Alt+M shortcut?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan aktiveer die kieslys met die Ctrl+Alt+M kortpad?\n"

#: tips.cpp:64
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can rename your current Konsole session with the Ctrl+Alt+S "
"shortcut?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan herbenaam jou huidige Konsole sessie met die Ctrl+Alt+S "
"kortpad?\n"

#: tips.cpp:69
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can create your own session types by using the session \n"
