"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:82
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can move a session by holding down the middle mouse button over "
"the tab?\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan begin nuwe Konsole sessies deur gedruk die \"nuwe\" knoppie in "
"die Konsole nutsbalk?\n"

#: tips.cpp:88
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can reorder the session tabs with \"View->"
